    {"step": 1, "tactic": "LDAP filter on DONT_REQ_PREAUTH UAC bit", "technique": "T1558.004", "what_happened": "At 2032-02-14 22:18:08 UTC, AMSI EID 4104 captured a powershell.exe scriptblock on WS-CORP-104 issuing LDAP search '(&(objectCategory=user)(userAccountControl:1.2.840.113556.1.4.803:=4194304))' — the OID-based bitwise AND filter for UAC 0x400000 (DONT_REQ_PREAUTH). Rule 92210 triggered.", "chain_reason": "This specific LDAP OID filter has one purpose: enumerate accounts whose Kerberos pre-authentication is disabled — the prerequisite for AS-REP roasting."},
    {"step": 2, "tactic": "KDC TCP/88 probe + AS-REQ without PreAuth", "technique": "T1558.004", "what_happened": "At 2032-02-14 22:18:25, Sysmon EID 3 captured 4 outbound TCP connections from powershell.exe on WS-CORP-104 to DC-CORP-01.corp.local:88. AS-REQ probes followed for the enumerated candidate accounts.", "chain_reason": "Raw TCP/88 to the KDC from PowerShell with no preceding kinit is not a normal user workflow — combined with the DONT_REQ_PREAUTH filter it is the AS-REP roast network primitive."},
    {"step": 3, "tactic": "4768 PreAuthType=0 burst from one source", "technique": "T1558.004", "what_happened": "Between 2032-02-14 22:18:26 and 22:19:08, DC-CORP-01 Security log recorded 7 Event 4768 (TGT requested) from ipAddress 10.40.55.104 (WS-CORP-104), all with PreAuthType=0 (NO pre-authentication required), for accounts legacy_svc, old_app_user, iis_pool_2008, sccm_legacy, vmware_view, sharepoint_2010, exchange_legacy. Rule 60101 triggered.", "chain_reason": "PreAuthType=0 means the KDC returned the AS-REP encrypted with the account's RC4 key WITHOUT prior pre-auth verification — the response blob is offline-crackable. 7 such requests in 42 s from one workstation is the canonical AS-REP roast burst."},
    {"step": 4, "tactic": "Tool literal (Get-ADUser DoesNotRequirePreAuth / GetNPUsers / rubeus asreproast)", "technique": "T1558.004", "what_happened": "AMSI EID 4104 scriptblock content includes the literal pattern matching 'rubeus.exe asreproast /format:hashcat' AND/OR 'Get-ADUser -Filter {DoesNotRequirePreAuth -eq $true}'. Rule 92210 fired.", "chain_reason": "The 'DoesNotRequirePreAuth -eq $true' filter or 'rubeus asreproast' literal in PowerShell scriptblocks is signature offensive tooling — no legitimate Windows administration script uses these strings."}
